# Agent runtime env — platform-managed deployment.
#
# WHO WRITES THIS FILE
#   The platform control-plane writes this file during "materialize":
#     POST /api/agents/<id>/materialize
#
# That materialize step writes the Agent's `.env` from the current `agent.yaml`
# references (`models.targets[*].api_key_env`, `mcp_servers[*].api_key_env`, and
# connector `*_env`) and preserves operator-filled values. Do not maintain a static
# inventory of model, Slack, MCP, or Knowledge Base source secret names here.
#
# Secrets are NEVER inlined in agent.yaml. Never commit this file with real values.
# For standalone (no-platform) deployment see:
#   agents/default/.env.standalone.example
